<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge rises to 75.8300 per dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge rises to 75.8300 per dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.8300 per</p>
<p>dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Friday after</p>
<p>75.8500 on Thursday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     July 4		  July 3</p>
<p> High			     75.8525		 75.9200</p>
<p> Low				75.8000		 75.8500</p>
<p> Open			     75.8200		 75.8800</p>
<p> Close			    75.8300		 75.8500</p>
<p> Volume ($ million)	     6.075		   3.095</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
